{"overview":"وقتی گینتوکی با پسری جوان به نام سیتا که به‌عنوان دزدکشی زندگی می‌کند، ملاقات می‌کند، متوجه می‌شود که او دزدکشی می‌کند تا مادر گمشده‌اش، هیونووا، که شماره یک کورتسین در یوشیوارا است، را پیدا کند. گینتوکی و دوستانش به یوشیوارا می‌روند تا آرزوهای سیتا را برآورده کنند، اما در راهشان هوسن، پادشاه شب که یوشیوارا را حکمرانی می‌کند، قرار دارد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Upon meeting a young boy named Seita who makes a living as a pickpocket, Gintoki discovers that he is pickpocketing out of a desire to meet his long-lost mother, Hinowa, Yoshiwara's number one courtesan. Gintoki and his friends venture to Yoshiwara to fulfill Seita's wish, but standing in their way is Housen, the Night King who rules Yoshiwara.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["安藤尚也"],"crew_en":["Naoya Ando"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"杉田智和","role":"Gintoki Sakata (voice)","photo":"/cv5zuPZySNsHXu24pjKLYCRzJ2J.jpg","en":"Tomokazu Sugita"},{"name":"阪口大助","role":"Shinpachi Shimura (voice)","photo":"/cP9lnoYSCyIpSlUkZN4k6RoD7fF.jpg","en":"Daisuke Sakaguchi"},{"name":"釘宮理恵","role":"Kagura (voice)","photo":"/xHonhNFpTpz9zCVXLAF7D4OuHLv.jpg","en":"Rie Kugimiya"},{"name":"日野聡","role":"Kamui (voice)","photo":"/8ZJIiwIVF2zDyyFr7oXewj0eEuu.jpg","en":"Satoshi Hino"},{"name":"甲斐田裕子","role":"Tsukuyo (voice)","photo":"/wttsRGyYySLPfNcDtAbNLVizHLx.jpg","en":"Yuhko Kaida"},{"name":"銀河万丈","role":"Housen (voice)","photo":"/qiXnKaZheMiVyA1U2mX9tPdNA3T.jpg","en":"Banjo Ginga"},{"name":"三瓶由布子","role":"Seita (voice)","photo":"/gms4G7ZRIQYXI9zsorkQr8aHnOU.jpg","en":"Yuko Sanpei"},{"name":"井上喜久子","role":"Hinowa (voice)","photo":"/pPxGWy53FgYSC79zmxblmHe0gI3.jpg","en":"Kikuko Inoue"},{"name":"大塚芳忠","role":"Abuto (voice)","photo":"/3RHQcrsWnAFK6AifSis1lMq08cR.jpg","en":"Hochu Otsuka"},{"name":"山口勝平","role":"Inorin (voice)","photo":"/mJyxKRZxLv9D7LH5KcNSkjSKYOB.jpg","en":"Kappei Yamaguchi"},{"name":"石田彰","role":"Kotaro Katsura (voice)","photo":"/jnW2Gn2Nl